docs {
  # Batch Presigned Upload URLs (Protected)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/batch/presigned-upload`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token)

  ## Description

  Requests direct upload URLs for multiple files simultaneously (up to 50 items).

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `files` | `array` | Yes | Array of presigned upload requests (max 50) |
  | `files[].filename` | `string` | Yes | Original file name |
  | `files[].type` | `string` | Yes | Attachment type |
  | `files[].file_size_bytes` | `int64` | Yes | File size in bytes |
  | `files[].mime_type` | `string` | Yes | Declared MIME type |
  | `files[].group_id` | `int64` | No | Associated group ID |
  | `files[].expense_id` | `int64` | No | Associated expense ID |
  | `files[].is_public` | `boolean` | No | Whether the object is public |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "filename": "photo.jpg",
          "upload_url": "https://storage.example.com/uploads/raw-key.jpg?X-Amz-Signature=...",
          "object_key": "raw-key.jpg",
          "expires_at": "2026-11-02T19:15:00Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Empty files list or exceeds maximum limit of 50 items
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid token
  * `403 Forbidden` — Requester is not a member of the associated group
}
